      font-size="16px" font-weight="bold">PC 04.220  Radiant Rectangle with UDST</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="248">(Ugly-Duckling-to-Swan Transform) pavilion</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="266">Designed by Roland Arajs, October 2014</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black"><tspan x="230" y="284">Angles for R.I. = 1.540</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="302">44 facets + 8 girdles</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="320">2-fold, mirror-image symmetry; 96 index</tspan>
